Section-Specific Styles
Philosophy Section: White bg,  14rem  padding. Two-column grid. Floating wheel with circular icons (4.7rem circles, shadow  0 12px 30px rgba(32, 67, 131, 0.16) ).
Horizontal Scroll (Articles): Navy  #204383  bg. Cards: white/light gradient bg,  80vw  width,  500px  max,  height: 420px . Images:  filter: grayscale(1)  →  grayscale(0)  on hover. Hover:  translateY(-8px) . Uses GSAP ScrollTrigger for horizontal pinning.
Marquee (Logos): White bg. Infinite scroll animation ( 160s  loop). Logos:  height: 60px , hover  scale(1.05) .
Stats Section: White bg. Stats in 4-column grid. Counter animation with GSAP ScrollTrigger. Numbers:  font-size clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 6rem) , weight 900. Suffix: mint  #99cdb3 .
Certifications/Partners: Gradient bg  #f8fafc → #fff . Logo windows:  90px × 90px , transparent bg, hover  translateY(-3px) . Staggered entrance animation via IntersectionObserver.
Expertise:  #f8fafc  bg. 4-column grid with 1px gaps. Cards white bg, hover → navy  #204383  bg with white text. Icons transition to mint on hover.
Show More / CTA: Navy bg, centered text, mint button ( border-radius: 9999px ),  transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.05)  on hover.
Footer: Navy  #204383  bg, white text.  border-top: 1px solid rgba(153, 205, 179, 0.2) . Country cards:  rgba(255,255,255,0.05)  bg,  12px  radius. Social icons:  44px  circles, border  rgba(255,255,255,0.15) , hover → mint border/glow. Bottom bar: uppercase monospace,  letter-spacing: 0.5em ,  rgba(153,205,179,0.4) .
Page-Specific Styles
About Us: Parallax hero, scroll-reveal animations, 3D CSS globe with rotating wireframe rings, glassmorphism cards ( backdrop-filter: blur(15px) ), leadership cards with grayscale-to-color hover effect on images.
Articles Page:  #f8fafc  bg. Grid layout  repeat(auto-fit, minmax(400px, 1fr)) . Cards with  1px  border, hover  translateY(-6px) . Badge pills: navy bg, white text, uppercase. Filter toggle: 300px wide, navy active state.
Article Detail: Progress bar on scroll ( linear-gradient(90deg, #204383, #26c0af) ). Hero with glass panel ( rgba(255,255,255,0.92)  backdrop). Callout boxes with teal borders. Author block with navy avatar.
Contact Page: Banner image with gradient overlay. Form inputs:  #f8f9fc  bg,  1px solid rgba(21, 50, 90, 0.15) . Focus:  border-color: #99cdb3  with green glow. Custom select dropdown with animations. Dark CTA cards ( #163868 ).
Our Projects: Gradient hero ( #0d1a4a  →  #1e4280 ). Scroll-driven wheel/slider with smooth transitions. Cards with colored bands and dot indicators. Filter system by category/country with colored tag pills.
History Page: Interactive timeline with animated dots, floating bar that transitions from center to compact pill position, 3D sphere with orbiting logos (CSS preserve-3d), half-wheel on right side driven by scroll. Background color interpolates between milestones.
BFC Academy: Sticky hero with Framer Motion (width transforms on scroll), stacking certificate cards with  useScroll , 2-column layout for courses, pagination, filter sidebar.
Service Details: Multiple layout variants — clean card grid, image grid with hover-reveal overlays, list layout, outsourcing layout with team card and services panel. Subscribe banner with frosted glass style.
Admin Dashboard: Separate styling — navy/teal theme, grid of menu cards, table-based CRUD data display.
Animations & Interactions
- GSAP: Used for horizontal scroll (ScrollTrigger), stats counter animation
- Framer Motion: Used in BFC Academy for sticky hero scaling
- CSS keyframes: Pulse, float, fade-in, slide-reveal, marquee scroll, sphere rotation
- Hover effects: Scale transforms, color transitions, translate shifts, box-shadow elevation
- Scroll reveals: IntersectionObserver for fade-up/slide-up on scroll
- Image hover: Grayscale → color, scale transforms
- Link hover: Arrow rotation (45°), gap expansion, color changes
Responsive Breakpoints
- Mobile:  max-width: 768px  (primary breakpoint)
- Small mobile:  max-width: 480px 
- Tablet: Various breakpoints at  900px ,  1024px 
- Desktop:  min-width: 768px 
- Menu hides on mobile; single-column layouts; reduced font sizes; scrollable content instead of pinned.
